WEBVTT

00:43:27.837 --> 00:43:31.831
The political change ... I live near
Capitol Hill, and that I don't see yet.

00:43:31.855 --> 00:43:35.359
But that'll come last,
after we fix the society and the ideas.

00:43:35.986 --> 00:43:39.036
CA: Give us a sense of what
it feels like on the inside

00:43:39.060 --> 00:43:44.751
of being a Republican who is not
in love with the current president.

00:43:44.775 --> 00:43:47.934
DB: It wasn't that bumpy.
I really didn't lose a lot of my friends.

00:43:47.958 --> 00:43:49.427
If you look at my résumé,

00:43:49.451 --> 00:43:51.933
I worked at the "Wall Street
Journal" editorial page.

00:43:51.957 --> 00:43:54.558
I worked at "National Review, '"
the "Weekly Standard,"

00:43:54.582 --> 00:43:55.734
the "Washington Times."

00:43:55.758 --> 00:43:57.418
I've sort of done the whole thing.

00:43:57.442 --> 00:43:59.654
I worked at the Hoover
Institution at Stanford.

00:43:59.678 --> 00:44:04.072
But I would say most of my friends
are all Never Trumpers.